      "text": "region = a geographic area;  AZ = one or more data centers;  inside them, as many machines as you pay for",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "region = a geographic area;  AZ = one or more data centers;  inside them, as many machines as you pay for",
