      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AWS has a fixed list (eu-west-1,\nus-east-1, ap-southeast-2, ...).\nYou choose where to deploy.",
